>> Animal := Oġġett ġdid.
>> Factory := Oġġett ġdid.

Animal meta: ['ġdid'] agħmel: {
	>> animal := innifsu ġdid.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal meta: ['sound:'] agħmel: { :s
	proprju sound := s.
}.

Animal meta: ['sound'] agħmel: { <- proprju sound.
}.

>> Dog := Oġġett ġdid.
>> Cat := Oġġett ġdid.

Dog meta: ['ġdid'] agħmel: { <- Animal ġdid sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat meta: ['ġdid'] agħmel: { <- Animal ġdid sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Ħruġ ikteb: Dog ġdid sound, linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: Cat ġdid sound, linja-ġdida.

Factory meta: ['mix:and:'] agħmel: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal ġdid sound: (
		( beast1 sound minn: 0 tul: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound minn: 2 tul: 5 )
	).
}.

Ħruġ ikteb: (Factory mix: Dog ġdid and: Cat ġdid) sound, linja-ġdida.
